#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every feature is free: all {templates} templates, PDF and Word downloads, the ATS checker, cover letters and the job tracker. There are no ads, no tracking and no paid tier. Donations pay for hosting and development."
msgstr "是的。每个功能都是免费的：所有 {templates} 模板、PDF 和 Word 下载、ATS 检查器、求职信和求职追踪器。没有广告，没有跟踪，也没有付费等级。捐款用于支付托管和开发费用。"

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every job you track gets its own workspace: check your fit against the posting, draft answers from stories you wrote once, get a short plan before the interview, practice out loud with feedback and debrief afterwards. When offers arrive, compare them side by side. The coaching uses your own AI key; the comparison doesn’t need one."
msgstr "可以。您追踪的每个职位都有自己的工作区：对照职位公告检查匹配度，用写过一次的故事起草回答，在面试前获取简短计划，大声练习并获得反馈，事后进行复盘。收到录用通知时，可以并排比较。辅导使用您自己的 AI 密钥；比较功能则不需要。"

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Import a PDF, a LinkedIn data export, a JSON Resume file or a Reactive Resume export, then pick up where it left off. With an AI provider set up, Word documents work too."
msgstr "是的。导入 PDF、LinkedIn 数据导出、JSON Resume 文件或 Reactive Resume 导出，然后从中断处继续。设置 AI 提供商后，Word 文档也可以工作。"

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Reactive Resume is open source under the MIT License and ships as a Docker image, so it runs on your own server with your own database and storage."
msgstr "是的。 Reactive Resume 在 MIT License 下开源，并作为 Docker 映像提供，因此它可以在您自己的服务器上运行，并具有您自己的数据库和存储。"

